# API conventions

- JSON in/out
- 401 unauthenticated; 404 (preferred) or 403 for cross-user resource access — pick one and stay consistent
- 400 for validation with a clear body
- Do not return stack traces to clients in production-like config
- Internal jobs (e.g. process-due reminders) must not be anonymously callable

Keep controllers thin: validation + authz + call application/domain service.

Target layout when code exists: `apps/api` (or equivalent).
